# MTG Database Integration & Optimization Walkthrough

We have successfully unified your MTG and Pokémon data into a single, high-performance database structure.

## 🏆 Key Achievements

### 1. Successful Data Migration
- **109,043 MTG Cards** imported into the [pokemon](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Admin.php#39-50) database.
- Data successfully transformed from raw text into optimized types (`INT`, `DECIMAL`, `VARCHAR`).
- Normalized relational tables created for:
  - **Colors** (103,051 entries)
  - **Types** (113,670 entries)
  - **Subtypes** (102,024 entries)
  - **Keywords** (65,859 entries)

### 2. Database-Wide Collation Standardization
- **Fixed "Illegal mix of collations" errors** by standardizing the entire [pokemon](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Admin.php#39-50) database.
- Converted all 14+ Pokémon and MTG tables to `utf8mb4_unicode_ci`.
- This ensures seamless JOINs between the different TCG systems (Pokémon, MTG, etc.).

### 3. Application Simplification
- **Removed the redundant [mtg](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Store.php#58-69) database configuration** from [application/config/database.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/config/database.php).
- **Refactored [Mtg_model.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Mtg_model.php)** to use the primary database connection.
- **Improved Query Performance** by switching from the 152MB `mtg_cards_raw` text table to indexed, typed tables.

## 📂 Updated Files

- [database.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/config/database.php): Cleaned up and simplified.
- [Mtg_model.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Mtg_model.php): Updated for the new centralized architecture.
- [optimize_mtg_in_pokemon.sql](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/db/migrations/optimize_mtg_in_pokemon.sql): Final normalization script used.

## 🚀 How to Verify

1.  **Check SQLyog**: You should see your [mtg_cards](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Admin.php#82-89) table populated with 109,043 rows.
2.  **Browse the Store**: Visit your MTG store section; it should now load faster and show all attributes correctly.
3.  **Admin Panel**: Your MTG inventory management remains fully functional but now runs on the optimized database.

> [!TIP]
> You can now safely delete the `mtg_cards_raw` table in SQLyog when you are ready to save disk space, as all data is now in the optimized [mtg_cards](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Admin.php#82-89) table!
